## Configuration

### config/asentric.yaml

| Section | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `chain` | Blockchain connection (chain ID, RPC endpoints) |
| `source` | Event source (websocket recommended) |
| `sink` | Alert destination (console or webhook) |
| `debug` | Enable debug logging |

### config/registry.yaml

Define contracts to monitor:

```yaml
targets:
  - address: "0x..."
    name: "My Contract"
    abi_path: "abi/mycontract.json"
```

